  "description": "Due to her stunning beauty and superb acting skills, actress Shin Sojin has been loved by everyone... except for Mrs. Jung, a cruel tycoon who has tormented Sojin all her life. But when wealthy CEO, Kang Seung-Won, offers her a sponsorship, Sojin seizes the chance to take her down. With Seung-Won by her side, Sojin slowly works toward getting her vengeance. But the closer she gets to her goal, the more she begins to realize that there is something deeper and darker about this arrangement...\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
